# saan — system design

*saan* (Filipino for "where?") is a privacy-first, local file launcher. This
document describes the architecture as implemented in this repository. Every
claim below is grounded in the code; file paths are relative to the repo root.

## Components

| Component | Location | Responsibility |
|---|---|---|
| `saan-core` library | `crates/core/src` | Chunking, embedding, extraction, index, router, grep, glob, Jev client, engine. |
| `saan` CLI | `crates/cli/src/main.rs` | `fetch-model`, `index`, `search`, `grep`, `glob`, `eval`, `bench`. |
| Tauri app | `src-tauri/src/main.rs` | Desktop window + global hotkey, Tauri commands, engine state, Jev wiring. |
| Frontend | `index.html`, `src/main.ts` | Plain TypeScript launcher UI (debounced search, keyboard nav, folder setup). |

